sinstance(max_message_chars, bool) or not isinstance(max_message_chars, int):\n                raise ValueError(\"max_message_chars must be an int >= 32 or None\")\n            if max_message_chars < 32:\n                raise ValueError(...)\n        self.max_message_chars = max_message_chars\n```\n\nSetup logger: `from deepinfer.environ import envs`? Check logger.py imports. Let me read logger.py top (1-32) and end (107-end).\n\n3. stats_logger: `logger.info(m, extra={\"keep_full_message\": True})`.\n\nLet me read needed regions now."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7151,"completion_tokens":1503,"total_tokens":8654,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4096},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1292},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4096,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3055},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}